OL,3,GNEWSAReform wins by-elections after    
OL,4,Aoffensive comments                     
OL,6,FOn Thursday night, Reform held one seat
OL,7,Fin Shard End on Birmingham City Council
OL,8,Fand three seats in Castle Bromwich on  
OL,9,FSolihull Metropolitan Borough Council. 
